## Build & Run

### Environment Requirements

- Android Studio (version supporting AGP 9.0.1)
- JDK 11+
- Android SDK (compileSdk 36)

### Runtime Requirements

- Device must be equipped with an accelerometer (G-Sensor)
- Game is forced to landscape orientation
- Devices without a sensor will show a prompt and exit

## Core Gameplay

1. After launching the game, a splash animation plays, then the game main screen appears
2. Tilt the device to control the ball rolling through the maze
3. The ball must avoid holes (traps) and reach the finish to complete the level
4. Each level records the completion time and number of attempts
5. Game progress is automatically saved and can be resumed on the next launch

